  "description": "Linux backend for Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebView.Maui (BlazorWebView). Adds .UseLinuxBlazorWebView() to your MAUI app builder; hosts Blazor Hybrid apps in WPE WebKit composited inside the OpenMaui Skia render tree on native Wayland and X11. Requires WPE WebKit 2.54+ on the host (Debian/Ubuntu: libwpewebkit-2.0-1; Fedora: dnf copr enable philn/wpewebkit). Opt-in: install this package only if your app uses BlazorWebView on Linux.",
